&lt;p&gt;Whether you&apos;re looking to join the orchestra or just want to hear us play, here is where you can find us:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;tuesday-15-september&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#tuesday-15-september&quot; aria-label=&quot;tuesday 15 september permalink&quot; class=&quot;anchor before&quot;&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Tuesday 15 September&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Activities Fair Stall&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Bristo Square&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time:&lt;/strong&gt; 10:00am – 4:00pm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Come by our stall to chat with current members, ask questions, and learn more about playing with EUSO!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Activities Fair Trio Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Bristo Square&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time:&lt;/strong&gt; 11:00am&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;thursday-17-september&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#thursday-17-september&quot; aria-label=&quot;thursday 17 september permalink&quot; class=&quot;anchor before&quot;&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Thursday 17 September&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Auditions (Day 1)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Alison House, Lecture Theatre A&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time:&lt;/strong&gt; 9:00am – 5:00pm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EUSO / EUCO Scratch Rehearsal&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Reid Concert Hall&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time:&lt;/strong&gt; 5:00pm – 9:00pm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join us alongside the Edinburgh University Chamber Orchestra (EUCO) for a relaxed, open scratch rehearsal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;friday-18-september&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#friday-18-september&quot; aria-label=&quot;friday 18 september permalink&quot; class=&quot;anchor before&quot;&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Friday 18 September&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Auditions (Day 2)&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Alison House, Lecture Theatre A&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time:&lt;/strong&gt; 9:00am – 5:00pm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;audition-preparation&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#audition-preparation&quot; aria-label=&quot;audition preparation permalink&quot; class=&quot;anchor before&quot;&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Audition Preparation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please prepare a short solo piece or movement of your choice (approx. 3–5 minutes). We welcome string players from all faculties and degree disciplines, as well as non-students.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information on joining, check our &lt;a href=&quot;/join/&quot;&gt;Join Us&lt;/a&gt; page or reach out via our &lt;a href=&quot;/contact/&quot;&gt;Contact Page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</content:encoded><author>euso.president@gmail.com</author></item><item><title><![CDATA[We Are Back Online!]]></title><description><![CDATA[After a four-year hiatus, the official Edinburgh University String Orchestra website is finally back up and running! We have refreshed our digital home just in time for the 2026/2…]]></description><link>https://string.eusa.ed.ac.uk//2026-09-07-we-are-back-online/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://string.eusa.ed.ac.uk//2026-09-07-we-are-back-online/</guid><category><![CDATA[euso]]></category><category><![CDATA[news]]></category><category><![CDATA[website]]></category><category><![CDATA[edinburgh]]></category><category><![CDATA[orchestra]]></category><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;p&gt;After a four-year hiatus, the official Edinburgh University String Orchestra website is finally back up and running!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have refreshed our digital home just in time for the 2026/27 academic year. Going forward, you will be able to find all our latest updates, concert announcements, audition schedules, and outreach events right here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;whats-ahead&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#whats-ahead&quot; aria-label=&quot;whats ahead permalink&quot; class=&quot;anchor before&quot;&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; focusable=&quot;false&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 16 16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; d=&quot;M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;What&apos;s Ahead&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome Week:&lt;/strong&gt; Meet us at the Activities Fair and join our scratch rehearsal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Auditions:&lt;/strong&gt; Taking place on 17th and 18th September—check out the &lt;a href=&quot;/join/&quot;&gt;Join Us&lt;/a&gt; page for the sign-up link.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Concerts:&lt;/strong&gt; Keep an eye on our &lt;a href=&quot;/concerts/&quot;&gt;Concerts&lt;/a&gt; page as we announce our repertoire and performance dates for the upcoming semester.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your patience while we tuned up behind the scenes. We are thrilled to be back and cannot wait to share our music with you this year!&lt;/p&gt;</content:encoded><author>euso.president@gmail.com</author></item><item><title><![CDATA[Our Upcoming Winter Concert]]></title><description><![CDATA[Hey all, Our winter concert is coming up soon!
