&lt;p&gt;If you can’t make it in person, you can also send in a video. Recordings on phones are fine, as long as it can record a video with sound. However, in-person auditions are preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:euso.president@gmail.com&quot;&gt;contact our president&lt;/a&gt; for details on how to sign up.&lt;/p&gt;</content:encoded><author>euso.president@gmail.com</author></item><item><title><![CDATA[Our Upcoming Spring Concert]]></title><description><![CDATA[Hey all, Our spring concert is coming up soon!
