&lt;p&gt;If interested, &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:euso.president@gmail.com&quot;&gt;email our president&lt;/a&gt; as soon as possible. We are looking forward to seeing your submissions!&lt;/p&gt;</content:encoded><author>euso.president@gmail.com</author></item><item><title><![CDATA[Audition Registrations Are Open Now!]]></title><description><![CDATA[It’s audition season! Want to join EUSO? Sign up via this link to receive your orchestral excerpt and the access to the Google Folder. From there, you can send us your recordings…]]></description><link>https://string.eusa.ed.ac.uk//2021-09-13-auditions-registration/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://string.eusa.ed.ac.uk//2021-09-13-auditions-registration/</guid><category><![CDATA[auditions]]></category><category><![CDATA[edinburgh university string orchestra]]></category><category><![CDATA[edinburgh]]></category><category><![CDATA[university of edinburgh]]></category><pubDate>Mon, 13 Sep 2021 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;p&gt;It’s audition season! Want to join EUSO? Sign up via &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSebizcEWmpdBvc7sCeDUjTslz_-MRFtZhnF6nYGwqUnYgR3SQ/viewform&quot;&gt;this link&lt;/a&gt; to receive your orchestral excerpt and the access to the Google Folder.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From there, you can send us your recordings of a piece and the orchestral excerpt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quality of your recording doesn’t matter, we’re just looking for a visual and audio! The deadline for submitting your audition is this Friday, 17th September, at noon.&lt;/p&gt;</content:encoded><author>euso.president@gmail.com</author></item><item><title><![CDATA[Auditions Starting Soon]]></title><description><![CDATA[For this year's auditions, you should record a piece or an excerpt of a piece or movement, between 2-5 mins long, and upload it to a Google Drive once you have signed up. The…]]></description><link>https://string.eusa.ed.ac.uk//2021-09-09-auditions/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://string.eusa.ed.ac.uk//2021-09-09-auditions/</guid><category><![CDATA[auditions]]></category><category><![CDATA[edinburgh university string orchestra]]></category><category><![CDATA[edinburgh]]></category><category><![CDATA[university of edinburgh]]></category><pubDate>Thu, 09 Sep 2021 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;p&gt;For this year&apos;s auditions, you should record a piece or an excerpt of a piece or movement, between 2-5 mins long, and upload it to a Google Drive once you have signed up. The deadline for recordings will be &lt;code class=&quot;language-text&quot;&gt;12pm (noon) on Friday 17th&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There will also be an orchestral excerpt to record to which you will access once you have signed up. Recordings on phones are fine, as long as it can record a video with sound.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Details on how to sign up will follow soon. If you have any questions until then, feel free to &lt;a href=&quot;/contact&quot;&gt;contact&lt;/a&gt; us.&lt;/p&gt;</content:encoded><author>euso.president@gmail.com</author></item><item><title><![CDATA[Starting with Auditions]]></title><description><![CDATA[As of today, we're accepting new sign-ups for auditions until Thursday 24th September. Simply click the button below:]]></description><link>https://string.eusa.ed.ac.uk//2020-09-14-auditions/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://string.eusa.ed.ac.uk//2020-09-14-auditions/</guid><category><![CDATA[auditions]]></category><category><![CDATA[edinburgh university string orchestra]]></category><category><![CDATA[edinburgh]]></category><category><![CDATA[university of edinburgh]]></category><pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2020 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;p&gt;As of today, we&apos;re accepting new sign-ups for auditions until Thursday 24th September. Simply click the button below:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/jFvfjCwuLMfJCAjb9&quot;&gt;
  &lt;button&gt;
    Sign up for auditions now
  &lt;/button&gt;
